# GI-OVERRIDE-FORCE: an explicit machine override of GlobalIllumination.Method REPLACES the view's PostProcessSettings request (Starter's PPV asks Off since scene v73); a Scalability level stays only a ceiling.
Дано state
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method SoftwareTraced"
Когда state
Тогда 0_override Starter в Lit с override GI = SoftwareTraced: кадр освещён, не чёрный; в editor.log строка «[RenderMethods] GI: Off -> SoftwareTraced (machine override GlobalIllumination.Method = SoftwareTraced)», а не Off
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Тогда 1_level override снят (machine.json чист): GI снова по уровню, кадр освещён
